@startuml
title Decorator - Toast (Solution) - Sequence Diagram

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "client" as C
participant "salad: Salad" as S
participant "ketchup: Ketchup" as K
participant "tomato: Tomato" as T
participant "sausage: Sausage" as SA
participant "cheese: Cheese" as CH
participant "bread: ToastBread" as B

C -> S : calculatePrice()
activate S
S -> K : calculatePrice()
activate K
K -> T : calculatePrice()
activate T
T -> SA : calculatePrice()
activate SA
SA -> CH : calculatePrice()
activate CH
CH -> B : calculatePrice()
activate B
B --> CH : 5
deactivate B
CH --> SA : 5 + 3 = 8
deactivate CH
SA --> T : 8 + 3 = 11
deactivate SA
T --> K : 11 + 2 = 13
deactivate T
K --> S : 13 + 1 = 14
deactivate K
S --> C : 14 + 2 = 16
deactivate S

note over C, B
  The request travels **down** to the bread,
  and the price is assembled **on the way back up**.
  No participant knows how long the chain is,
  and none of them knows it is in one.
end note

@enduml
